==Battleground==
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is essentially just [[Annin Pass]] but with Relic Doge as support. [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Modern Cat]] and some stackable DPS units like [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Slapstick Cats]] will completely solo this stage. Do note that if you're worried about the Oldhorn pushing, a [[Talents|talented]] [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo]] can be used to slow the enemies.

